# Live: click and hold on the box's front face: the Select Other list shows
# everything under the cursor, front to back. The second entry is the face
# the ray leaves through (the bottom, hidden); choosing it selects it, and E
# extrudes that face (the box grows downwards).
waitfor tsr.feature.extrude
wait 600
whold 20 0 10 900
waitfor selectOther
wait 300
shot /tmp/live_select_other.png
click selectOther.2
wait 400
key e
waitfor panelOk
wait 500
click panelOk
wait 1000
